      color: "$darkGray"
      fontFamily: "QuattrocentoSans"
      lineHeight: 1.3
      align: [left, middle]
      text: |
        <p>Attention mass on neighbours (1 − self-loop weight) over 2021–2026. No break at the IS/OOS boundary.</p>
